  "releaseNotes": "First release of the detached-signature package, versioned in lockstep with the PostQuantum.FileEncryption family. Sign files, streams, or buffers with Ed25519 + ML-DSA-65 hybrid signatures; verify fail-closed. The .sig sidecar format v1 is documented in docs/SIGNATURE-FORMAT.md. No change to the .pqfe v2 container format, which remains FROZEN for the 1.x line.",
